    body = [=[
* **{c=red:Note:}** If you just finished {p:Ghosts of the Past}, then you must zone before beginning this quest

=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Oggbi} inside the __Steaming Sheep Restaurant__ for a cutscene.
** You must be on Monk. **Once the Quest is active you can complete it on any job.**
** You must zone after completing the previous quest.
* Travel to {z:Fei'Yin}. Your goal is to zone into, and then out of {z:Qu'Bia Arena} for a cutscene and receive the key item {k:Letter from Dalzakk}.
** You can use the {p:Home Point} warp #1 if you have it.
* Travel to {z:Davoi} and look for the **Hide Flap** at (F-7)/(G-7).
* When ready click the **Hide Flap** and pop {m:Deloknok} (PLD) and {m:Bilopdop} (MNK). Kill them, then search for where the **Hide Flap** moved to and check for the key item {k:San d'Orian martial arts scroll}.
** There is only one **Hide Flap** and it moves to another random hut in the area after any player searches a hut. It can appear on any of the huts near (F-7)/(G-7).
** If completing this for multiple players, each player on the quest will need to trigger the NMs once before being able to retrieve the key item.
** Once the key item is retrieved, there appears to be a cool down of a few minutes before the NMs can be spawned again. Searching a hut during this time period will result in finding nothing without spawning the NMs, and the **Hide Flap** will move to a new location.
* Go back and talk to {p:Oggbi} and receive your {i:Temple Gaiters|Temple Gaiters|14090}.

